        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana WBR1850H, 17-3/4\" Combination Level Rectangular Wire Basket With Hook</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNever have storage issues again--at least not in the bathroom. The WBR1850H Rectangular Wire Basket is perfect for storing all your bathroom toiletries from shampoo bottles to soap; and the convenient hook is perfect for hanging your loofa. But this shelf is also useful in all parts of the house including the kitchen, the garage, and the kid's rooms. Made by Deltana out of solid brass, it is available in satin nickel, polished nickel, polished chrome, and pvd polished brass finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-WBR1850H-specifications.gif?v=1704354764\" width=\"501\" height=\"315\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana WBR1850H 17-3/4\" Rectangular Wire Basket With Hook Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/collections/bathroom-hardware-1\"><b>Deltana Wire Baskets</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the WBR1850H Solid Brass Rectangular Basket With Hook:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 17-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Depth (lowest level): 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Depth (highest level): 1\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-WBR1850H.pdf?v=1704262293\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana WBR1850H 17-3/4\" Rectangular Wire Basket With Hook Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 basket, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>",
